# Purpose

This document defines the documentation engineering standards for the hubIO platform.

Its purpose is to establish documentation as a shared engineering knowledge system that preserves architectural intent, business understanding, and operational context throughout the lifecycle of the platform.

---

# Scope

This standard defines:

* Documentation philosophy
* Knowledge architecture
* Documentation ownership
* Documentation consistency
* Documentation governance
* Knowledge evolution

It intentionally excludes documentation tooling, markdown syntax, publishing platforms, and implementation-specific documentation technologies, which are defined by their respective Engineering Standards.

---

# Constitutional Interpretation

This document extends the hubIO Engineering Constitution.

It applies constitutional engineering principles to engineering knowledge, ensuring documentation remains accurate, understandable, and valuable as the platform evolves.

